; A transaction with more than two strings is read to its end and then
; rejected. That is no syntax error, so a syntax error right after it is
; still reported: the comment in column 1 ends the transaction's body, and
; the posting under it is an indented line at top level.
2020-01-01 open Expenses:B

2020-01-02 * "one" "two" "three"
; a comment in column 1
  Expenses:B  1.00 USD

2020-01-03 * "one" "two" "three"
  Expenses:B  1.00 USD
  Expenses:B  -1.00 USD
